(7686704, 1258715, 67145, '<td valign="top">i love books .. especially old ones .. i can rarely stop myself putting one to my nose and drawing in that wonderful scent .. i bet this book smelt delicious .. !! .. <br/>my only disappointment is that i dont know what the book is about .. <br/>300 years old .. would transport the reader to another time and place .. very different to the one we are in now .. <br/>having said that .. many ideas that ppl had years and years ago survive to this day as wonderful insightful and meaningful texts . take Cicero (106-43 BC) "gratitude is not only the greatest of virtues, but the parent of all others." <br/> <br/>many congratulations on the blue .. seems you attract them to you like flies to honey .. please excuse the reference .. i''m an insect person after all .. i''ll rephrase that .. i''m a lover of insects after all .. ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-02-12 03:00:53.</i></td>', 'i love books .. especially old ones .. i can rarely stop myself putting one to my nose and drawing in that wonderful scent .. i bet this book smelt delicious .. !! .. my only disappointment is that i dont know what the book is about .. 300 years old .. would transport the reader to another time and place .. very different to the one we are in now .. having said that .. many ideas that ppl had years and years ago survive to this day as wonderful insightful and meaningful texts . take Cicero (106-43 BC) "gratitude is not only the greatest of virtues, but the parent of all others."  many congratulations on the blue .. seems you attract them to you like flies to honey .. please excuse the reference .. i''m an insect person after all .. i''ll rephrase that .. i''m a lover of insects after all .. ;)', '2021-02-12 03:00:13.000000', '2021-02-12 03:00:53.000000', 0),
